gure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"margin-top: 2em\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Modern &amp; Contemporary</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-63375db1 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/07/09/向前走-형졩걀-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">向前走</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Hiòng-jien-kiá̰</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/06/28/浪流連-렁류롄-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">浪流連</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Long-liû-liên</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2024/12/07/敢傻敢衝-諺文-中文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">敢傻敢衝</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Gǎn shǎ gǎn chōng</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/11/24/閣愛妳一擺-곻애릐짇배-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">閣愛妳一擺</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Kôh-ài-lì jit-pài</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2026/03/24/happy運將情歌-happy운쟝졩과-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">Happy!!! 運將情歌</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Happy!!! Ùn-jiang jieng-koâ</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/12/08/一吋相思一吋淚-짇춘슐싀짇춘뤼-諺文歌詞/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">一吋相思一吋淚</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Jit-chùn-siṵ̄-sî jit-chùn-lūi</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/04/08/寫一條歌寫你我爾爾-샤짇ᄃᆤ과샤릐꽈냐냐-諺文歌/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">寫一條歌，寫你我爾爾</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Siâ-jit-tiau-koâ, siâ-lî-goà nia-niā</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-dark-gray-color has-pale-ocean-gradient-background has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-element-button\" href=\"/2025/10/27/愛情你比我想的閣較偉大-애졩릐비꽈슐에곻캏위대/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">愛情你比我想的閣較偉大</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Ài-jieng-lì pî-goà siṵ̄’e kôh-khâh-wî-tāi</span></span></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Urban Ballads</h3>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2026/08/05/%e9%96%80-%eb%af%95-%e8%ab%ba%e6%96%87%e6%ad%8c%e8%a9%9e/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">門</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">Mńg</span></span></a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2026/07/17/maybe-maybe-%eb%a9%94%ec%82%90%eb%a9%94%ec%82%90-%e8%ab%ba%e6%96%87%e6%ad%8c%e8%a9%9e/\">Maybe Maybe</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-fill\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2026/07/13/%ce%b1%cf%86%cf%81%ce%bf%ce%b4%ce%af%cf%84%ce%b7-%ec%97%90%ed%9d%90%eb%a1%9c%eb%95%8c%eb%94%94-%e8%ab%ba%e6%96%87%e6%ad%8c%e8%a9%9e/\">Aphrodite (Αφροδίτη)</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-cyan-blue-to-vivid-purple-gradient-background has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://hokkienlang.wordpress.com/2026/07/12/%e6%89%8b%e6%8d%a7%e4%b8%80%e6%9d%af%e9%85%92-%ec%b8%84%ed%8c%a1%ec%a7%87%eb%b6%b8%ec%a5%ac-%e8%ab%ba%e6%96%87%e6%ad%8c%e8%a9%9e/\"><span style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">手捧一杯酒</span><span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;margin-top: -5px;f